# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.
# No key is needed for rungs 1, 2, 2.5 or 2.6 -- every one of them runs locally
# at $0.00. Rung 3 is the first thing in this project that spends money.

# Rung 3, the LLM reranker. https://openrouter.ai/keys
# ADR-0008 pins two open-weights models, 11.8x apart on price on purpose: a
# pair closer than this project's +/-6pp interval could not have produced a
# readable comparison.
#   openai/gpt-oss-120b        $0.037 / $0.17 per 1M   Apache-2.0
#   deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro   $0.435 / $0.87 per 1M   MIT
# Four runs -- each model at its least and most reasoning -- come to ~$1.75.
#
# The model ID alone does not determine the number. Both are served by many
# upstream providers at different prices AND different quantizations (fp4, fp8,
# bf16), so rung 3 pins the route with `provider.allow_fallbacks = false` and
# records which serve answered. See ADR-0008's second amendment.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional. Only silences a rate-limit warning when the rung-2 encoder or the
# rung-2.6 cross-encoder downloads weights from the Hugging Face Hub; both work
# without it, and neither needs an account. https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=
